# Generated / reproducible: never commit SWIG outputs, compiled artifacts, or
# test TIFFs. Schema: real_inc/ is the SWIG shim include dir; each language
# subdir holds generated wrappers + a gitignored compiled artifact.
real_inc/

# Python output dir (bindings/swig/python/)
python/_ptiff.so
python/ptiff.py
python/ptiff_wrap.c
python/roundtrip*.tif
python/__pycache__/

# Go: promoted to the official ../go/ptiff dir (bindings/go/ptiff/) -- SWIG
# is the primary Go binding layer, see the "alles in SWIG" migration notes in
# bindings/swig/README.md. Its generated output is ignored from bindings/go's
# own .gitignore, not here.

# Ruby output dir (bindings/swig/ruby/)
ruby/ptiff_wrap.c
ruby/*.bundle
ruby/*.so
ruby/roundtrip*.tif

# Stale artifacts in this dir (pre multi-language layout)
ptiff_wrap.c
ptiff.py
_ptiff.so
roundtrip.tif
__pycache__/

# The repo's root .gitignore ignores CMake-generated Makefiles. Our Makefile is
# hand-written and must be versioned; re-include it here.
!Makefile
